criteria: {"Modular": ["The spatial system should clearly read as an assembly of repeated units rather than one continuous mass.", "Percentage of occupied floor area generated from the repeated 9 × 9 m module — here, floor area inside 9 × 9 m module cells that are at least 70 % filled.", "Rating = that percentage × how clearly the zone's 54 module cells read as either full or empty (with a mix of both)."], "Fragmented": ["Large spaces should be broken into smaller identifiable spatial territories while remaining part of the whole.", "Number of distinct spatial units (work islands ≥ 6 m²) within the zone, counted on all six floors.", "Rating = island count ({islands:.0f} earns full marks) × cohesion, the share of mass joined into one body."], "Interlocking": ["Separate modules should connect horizontally and vertically to create relationships across multiple levels.", "Number of horizontal and vertical connections between adjacent occupied modules within the zone.", "Rating = all connections ({conn_total:.0f} = full marks) and offset ‘interlocking’ joints ({conn_interlock:.0f}), balanced between horizontal and vertical."], "Porous": ["Openings and voids should allow movement, views, and spatial continuity between otherwise separate areas.", "Percentage of the zone occupied by voids and openings versus solid, plus the openings that pierce right through it.", "Rating = void share (best between 50 and 66 %) × number of through-openings ({openings:.0f} = full marks)."], "Clustered": ["Workspaces should form recognizable groups of smaller units connected by shared circulation and social spaces.", "Number of individual modules contained within each identifiable cluster of firmly joined modules.", "Rating = best at 3–10 modules per cluster and 2–6 clusters × share of modules that belong to such clusters."], "Decentralized": ["Work, gathering, and social functions should be distributed throughout the building rather than concentrated around one center.", "Average distance from each occupied work module to its nearest gathering space (enclosed open pocket ≥ 12 m²).", "Rating = distance ({dist_best:.1f} m best, {dist_worst:.1f} m worst) × how many gathering spaces there are and how many floors they reach."], "Networked": ["Streets, bridges, stairs, and other circulation elements should provide multiple connections between work and social spaces.", "Number of circulation connections available to each module: streets, bridges and floor-to-floor links it touches.", "Rating = connections per module ({circ_per_module:.1f} = full marks) × share of modules with three or more."], "Layered": ["Work, circulation, and gathering should overlap spatially and vertically rather than functioning as completely isolated zones.", "Number of different functions within or directly adjacent to each module cell: work, link, street, gathering, terrace, covered space.", "Rating = functions per cell ({functions_per_cell:.1f} = full marks) × share of plan columns mixing three or more functions vertically."], "Intimate": ["Large-scale office space should be subdivided into smaller human-scaled territories that support a sense of enclosure and belonging.", "Average number of occupants accommodated within each work territory, at 10 m² per person.", "Rating = best at 4–12 occupants per territory × share of floor area in 20–150 m² territories."], "Visually Connected": ["People in separate modules and levels should maintain visual relationships through openings, edges, and voids.", "Percentage of occupied modules with a straight sightline across open space to another territory (3–24 m) or up/down to another level.", "Rating = average of the any-view and both-views shares × how many other territories each module sees ({targets_per_module:.1f} = full marks)."], "Socially Interactive": ["Circulation and shared spaces should create opportunities for informal encounters rather than only moving people between destinations.", "Number of gathering spaces directly connected to a major circulation route (a street of at least 12 m²).", "Rating = encounter points ({encounter_points:.0f} = full marks) × share of street area within 5 m of a gathering space."], "Village-Like": ["The building should read as a community of smaller territories, streets, shared spaces, and gathering nodes rather than a single institutional interior.", "Number of distinct work clusters, circulation streets, and shared gathering nodes within the zone.", "Rating = geometric mean of the three counts against {village_clusters:.0f} clusters, {streets:.0f} streets and {gather_nodes:.0f} nodes."]},
